  "construction": {
    "basis": "mixed",
    "fidelity": "adapted",
    "note": "The inner circle, twelve star lines and hexagonal tile use Samira Mian’s method. The actual lines to ink were reconstructed from the Met’s photograph of the minbar doors.",
    "changes": "The rosette is inked differently from the plain Mian tutorial to reproduce the doors: small star, kites, flat-ended shields and triangles between rosettes. A measured finished-design match is recorded; there is no published sequence for the entire door pattern.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-21"
  },
