    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Draw a straight line through S1 and S6, S2 and S7, S3 and S8, and S4 and S9. Draw a straight line through S5 and S10, S6 and S11, S7 and S12, and S8 and S1. Draw a straight line through S9 and S2, S10 and S3, S11 and S4, and S12 and S5. The twelve lines make a twelve-pointed star, and the sides of the kites and shields round it.",
      "create": {
        "s0": { "line": { "through": ["S1", "S6"] } },
